message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Sosyal Bilimciler İçin Claude Code Rehberi (Claude Code for Social Scientists)"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual Turkish and English open platform for social scientists using Claude Code and Codex.
  Fourteen curriculum categories, thirty-two reviewed skills, a safe cross-client installer, and a
  Social Scientist Agent support research, teaching, academic writing, evidence verification,
  reproducibility, ethics, privacy, and open science. Authored and maintained by a clinical
  psychologist and postdoctoral researcher, with structured AI-assistance disclosure and explicit
  human scientific authority.
